# Line endings are a correctness issue here, not cosmetics: the mandatory acceptance
# gate is a bash script that runs under WSL/Linux against this same working tree, and
# a CRLF checkout makes it fail on `\r`. Force LF for everything a shell or Docker
# consumes; text=auto keeps the usual normalisation for the rest.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
